VoicePointer

This project is an independent implementation. It does not copy source code
from artginzburg/MiddleClick (GPL-3.0). The gesture design was informed by
public documentation and the project's publicly described behavior.

The device/lifecycle notes also considered
SomeGuyNamedDaveIsTaken/macOSMiddleClick (MIT), but no source file from that
project is bundled here. If code is imported in the future, preserve the
corresponding copyright and license notices.

VoicePointer dynamically loads Apple's private MultitouchSupport framework at
runtime. Apple trademarks and frameworks remain Apple's property.
